    "created_at": "2020-10-14T20:02:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-10-14T20:02:17Z",
    "body": "Given that Chrome has this behavior already and the link in question was intended to be opened in any browser, I've decided to take the ol' try-it-and-see-what-breaks approach.  I'll let you know in a few months if it sticks.",
